# J.Lepreau, lepreau@utah-cs, harpo!utah-cs!lepreau
HE|esprit|hazeltine esprit:\
	:al=40\E^Z:bs:cd=5\E^X:ce=\E^O:cl=\E^\:cm=\E^Q%r%>^^ %+`%+`:co#80:\
	:dl=40\E^S:do=\E^K:ho=\E^R:li#24:nd=^P:se=\E^Y:so=\E^_:up=\E^L:
